            "paragraph": "Magnetite was added to the CAM5-chem/ATRAS2 model as a new aerosol species in this study. Nine aerosol species (sulfate, nitrate, ammonium, dust, sea salt, primary and secondary organic aerosol, BC, magnetite, and water) were treated in the model.",
